what is up everybody its Anna Mack here  for anime uproar and today we'll be  talking about the latest developments in  the block holders story including all  the speculation that the story could be  nearing its end  personally I don't agree that the story  is ending it is a popular manga with a  ton of potential and I certainly do not  want to see it end any time soon with  that said in the latest chapters of the  manga the single biggest conflict that  has been taking place since the series  began has seemingly wrapped up and many  people are wondering where the story  could possibly go from here I've been  seeing your comments asking this exact  question on many of our black clover  videos so in this video I will be  addressing your concerns and discussing  some of the possible directions that the  story can take from here if you enjoy  the block clover content on this channel  you want to see more you can leave a  like to let me know and if you're new to  anime uproar please don't forget to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  to turn on all notifications you can  follow me on twitter and instagram at  anime uproar for all the latest black  clover news and updates and finally this  video will be dealing with the latest  developments in the black clovers story  sold this video will contain manga  spoilers please proceed with caution you  have been warned  okay so in Chapter 213 of the manga we  finally got what appears to be a pretty  definitive conclusion to the primary  conflict of the black clover story since  the very beginning if you recall all the  way back to Heath Grice who is  introduced in chapter 6 of the manga he  was a villain who was a member of the  eye of the Midnight Sun for the next two  hundred-plus chapters the story has  revolved around the eye of The Midnight  Sun its leader lifts a cape a tree the  elves that Patri wants to resurrect in  order to exact revenge on humans because  of the elf Massacre and the actual truth  about the elf Massacre that we only  learned after the introduction of the  word magic devil so if we think about it  the entire story has been progressing  towards this major battle against the  devil and now seemingly that conflict is  resolved the devil has been defeated the  elf souls have finally found peace and  everything is finally going back to  normal  naturally this led a lot of people to  wonder what will happen now is this the  beginning of the end for the entire  story and if not where does the story go  from here now that the major conflict  which has been unraveling for over 200  chapters is finally over well first of  all we don't know for sure that this  conflict is completely over some  additional twist involving the word  magic devil could always be revealed  later since we know that this devil  isn't easy to kill and that he already  managed to resurrect himself once after  500 years of being dormant with all the  twists and turns that we have seen occur  during this whole elf saga I wouldn't be  too surprised if it turns out that not  everything is as it seems but even if  this really is it for the devil and even  if this epic saga really is completely  over I am certain that this is not the  end of black clover after all Austin you  know still haven't resolved their epic  rivalry to become the wizard king and  the one important thing that black Cobra  has going for it is its expansive and  extremely interesting world building now  if we were talking about a slice-of-life  high school anime and we suddenly had  all the main characters graduating from  high school in the manga then you would  be right to think that this might be the  end for the entire story rarely  slice-of-life high school stories do  continue after high school as was the  case with Clannad after story for  example but usually when such a major  change occurs the story will soon come  to an end however black clover is most  certainly not a slice-of-life high  school anime black clover does not take  place in a very specific and limited  setting that has a clear time limit for  how long the main characters can stay  there if the main characters are  students they have to finish school and  graduate eventually so that puts a time  frame on how long the story can keep  going in the same direction but black  clover takes place in an expansive  fantasy world that has almost unlimited  potential for new plot points and plot  twists with the devil defeated with all  the mysteries surrounding the elf  massacre revealed and with the elves  finally finding peace and willfully  leaving the bodies that they had been  possessing it is a bit daunting to try  to figure out where the story will go  from here after being used to this one  specific plot line for over 200 chapters  I understand why some fans are worried  but if you are worried just hear me out  for a minute  in the world of black clover it is  already established that there are  foreign nations including ones that are  close to the clover Kingdom and ones  that are far away such as the Land of  the Rising Sun it is also established  that there are ancient forms of magic  and dungeons that conceal this type of  magic so there are still many potential  mysteries within the clover kingdom  itself that can take the story in a new  and interesting direction not to mention  that we still don't even know who the  vice-captain of the black ball squad is  and I'm sure that that will become an  important plot point sometime in the  future finally with the introduction of  the word magic devil as a major villain  we learned that alternate dimensions  exist within the world of black clover  and that in some of these dimensions we  can find extremely powerful and evil  creatures like the devil himself  under certain circumstances these  creatures are capable of travelling into  the human world  possessing humans and objects and even  fully incarnated into this world with  the help of a five leaf grimoire like  the devil managed to do what's more we  also learned that the demon within osdas  grimoire is also a creature from another  dimension  pastas demon appears to be the same type  of creature as the word magic devil and  they appear to originate from the same  dimension from the brief dialogue  between Asta's demon and the devil it  seems that the devil is Austin's demon  senior meaning that he is older or  perhaps has a higher rank but this also  implies that these two demons are  definitely not the only demons out there  the dimension that they come from may  have thousands or even millions of these  types of demons and devils and some may  be even more powerful than the word  magic devil in fact there are still so  many mysteries surrounding the demon  inside of asters grimoire we all know  about his power to create anti magic and  nullify other forms of magic with it but  there are other powers that this demon  possesses that we don't even fully  understand yet such as when asta was  able to use the demon destroyer sword to  read Potteries memories enter his mind  and communicate with him on the inside  if fastest demon is capable of doing  this and we only just learned about it a  few chapters ago then what else is he  capable of doing and what is asked us  daemon truly after what are his ultimate  goals and motivations is Asta's demon  just interested in taking over austin's  body like he seems to  apply during Oscars fight against LOD  rose or is he after something else  entirely and if he is after Austin's  body what if at some point in the story  he succeeds in taking over hasta I'm  just talking hypothetically at this  point but maybe something bad will  happen to someone that hasta cares about  and this will lead him into despair  which will allow the demon to take over  if this happens we'll hasta the main  character and hero of the story become  the ultimate villain whatever happens I  am certain that Austin's devil his  mysterious origins and his true  intentions are going to become the main  subject of a future arc I just can't  imagine that such massive mysteries  could go unanswered and beyond the demon  there are so many other unsolved  mysteries out there the witch queen is a  character that is extremely mysterious  and I can definitely see her popping up  again in the near future  furthermore we still don't know whether  the demon dimension is the only  alternate dimension out there or whether  even more dimensions exist and these  dimensions could contain future threats  and challenges for Austin and the black  balls finally with the wizard king  Julius Noah chrono meeting his tragic  and during the elf saga at the hands of  Patri we still have the lingering  question of who will be the next wizard  king without a competent wizard king  like Julius the entire clover kingdom  will be at the mercy of the incredibly  pompous and inept king Augustus Kira  clover and that would cause a great deal  of social and political problems so Anu  qualified wizard King must be appointed  soon but as much as they want to become  the wizard King both Austin you know are  still too young and still nowhere close  to attaining a rank high enough to  become the wizard king so who will have  to replace Julius will it be Fugo Leon  no Zell silva will it be Yami or someone  else entirely this is another lingering  question that I've been wondering about  and by all means let me know who you  believe will be the next Wizard king  after Julius down in the comments below  this question will definitely be the  subject of a future arc sometime soon as  mentioned earlier I can definitely see  why some people are worried about where  the story will go from here since one  epic saga has spanned pretty much the  entire story  so far nevertheless I would not be  worried if I was you as I said black  Homer has already established a vast and  extremely interesting fantasy world full  of mysteries and new potential for  interesting plot points and plot twists  so Yuki Tabata will have plenty of  options for the story in the future  personally I'd love to know more about  the demon inside of Ava's grimoire about  the alternate dimensions and about the  witch queen but let me know what you  guys think  where will the story go from here and  what plot point do you want to see  explored further let me know down in the  comments if you enjoyed this video you  want to see more black clover content on  this channel please leave a like to let  me know and if you're new to anime  uproar don't forget to subscribe and hit  that notification bell also be sure to  follow me on twitter and instagram at  anime uproar for all the latest black  clover news and updates a huge thank you  to all of our anime uproar patrons for  supporting our work i want to give a  special thank you to our pro hero tear  patrons including the one and only  Gilgamesh nothing but a fan Jason Wilson  and King's elders another huge thank you  to our the one tier patrons the ones who  stand above all other clans including  baby ray ace ingrid ah a Lola nada madam  AK and makoto-kun and at the very  pinnacle of interdimensional greatness  the tier reserved only for legends a  massive thank you to Reagan Harrison a  disciple of Lords we go himself if you  guys feel that our content provides  value for you and you want to support  more be sure to check out our patreon  link in the description even donating a  single dollar will give you access to  our anime up for patron exclusive  discord and your name will appear in our  videos along with these amazing people  as always thank you guys so much for  watching I really appreciate it and  until next time see us space cowboys  [Music]

